---
name: Banking Jungle visual system
description: Locked Toxic Luxe jungle palette, condensed typography, and cinematic split-screen composition
 type: design
---
Use the Toxic Luxe palette: near-black #010604, deep jungle #064233, emerald #00D084, acid lime #B7FF00, icy white #E9FFF7. Use Bebas Neue for kinetic display headings and Barlow for interface/body text. Anchor the experience in a cinematic split-screen with kinetic messaging on the left and the living card/payment controls on the right. The selected direction is bioluminescent jungle glass: predatory, electric, cinematic, high-end, and never wellness-soft.
